                                                "sense_id": "7fa69bef-381f-37e8-ac35-c0bfd690d2ab",
                                                "text": "July 1836, A. B. (initials of author), London and Westminster Review Article XI, Bribery and Intimidation at Elections\nthe insufficiency of the ballot"
                                            },
                                            {
