                                                "sense_id": "7fa69bef-381f-37e8-ac35-c0bfd690d2ab",
                                                "text": "In the TSSA ballot, 80% of management grade and 60% of general grade members voted to accept, on an overall turnout of 57%."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
